  "title": "Baked BBQ Chicken with Sweet Potato and Cranberries",
  "description": "Baked BBQ chicken breasts are cooked with sweet potatoes and cranberries in this sweet and savory meal for two that&#39;s perfect for dinner on a cold winter night.",
  "authors": [
    "CAGEINCALI"
  ],
